  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Experiencing homelessness is a challenging and complex situation that affects many in Austin",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "(ECHO)](https://www.austinecho.org/) work diligently to address homelessness by coordinating resources and advocating for systemic change. Understanding the landscape of homelessness in Austin is the first step toward finding the right support and resources",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "how quickly circumstances can change. The first few nights on the street were incredibly stressful, and the experience can be overwhelming. It's important to know that you're not alone and that there are resources available to help you navigate this difficult time",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Finding a safe place to sleep is a critical immediate need",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "crucial to be proactive—call the properties, schedule appointments to pick up applications, and prepare all necessary documents. The process can take months, so starting early and staying persistent is key",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Nutrition is vital for health and well-being",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Access to healthcare is crucial:",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Mental health is a significant concern for many experiencing homelessness:",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Uber Eats** and **DoorDash** are options if you prefer food delivery",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "At one point, I didn't have a car but rented one through a ride-sharing platform. While the rental fees are high, it provided me with income and a place to sleep",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Getting around the city is essential:",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Can meet individuals where they are to provide services",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Experiencing homelessness is a challenging journey, but Austin offers a multitude of resources aimed at providing support and pathways to stability",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Remember that reaching out is a sign of strength, not weakness",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Utilizing resources, building a support network, and staying persistent are crucial steps toward a more stable and secure future",
